  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed financing consists of a loan convertible into shares of XANTE&amp;VI S.A.P.I de C.V. for up to MXN 500 million. Through this facility, IDB Invest seeks to support business growth and cover its operating needs, including the acquisition, maintenance, and renovation of homes. The ultimate beneficiaries will be owners of existing homes in the affordable and middle-income segments seeking a source of high liquidity; and new buyers who will have access to a greater supply of affordable, quality housing.</narrative>
  </description>
